message: "If you use MiniCpG, please cite the associated manuscript and the code version used."
title: "MiniCpG: Broad Validation and Characterization of a 30-CpG Cancer Classifier"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gutman"
    given-names: "Tal"
  - family-names: "Tuller"
